  chapterText:
      'The sudden blizzard that swept across the trekking route caught Devendra\'s group of six students '
      'almost entirely by surprise, transforming what had been a clear, sunlit trail into a disorienting wall '
      'of white within minutes. Their trek leader, an experienced mountaineer named Tenzing, quickly recognised '
